  "numberFormats": {
    "rules": [
      "Figures in Mono; units follow the figure with no space for %, $ and scale (18%, $1.9M) and a space for words (5 days, 0.5 FTE).",
      "Minus is U+2212 (−); ranges use an en dash (15–20%) with the unit once at the end.",
      "Scale: K, M, B, chosen so the figure keeps 1–3 significant digits before the decimal.",
      "Deltas carry a sign (+7 days, −7 days) and, in charts and tables, a direction mark.",
      "Rounding: one decimal for M and B under 10, none above; percentages whole unless under 10%."
    ],
